SUMMARY:Match Event: Art Reach with Indianapolis Art Center
DESCRIPTION:November              21              \, 2026            \n            BBBSCI hosts record-breaking annual gala\, “The Main Event\,” with Title Sponsor\, Delta Faucet Company           \n            Get creative with other matches every other Saturday at the Indy Art Center! \n\n                            Email Us to Learn More\n                      \n        \n      \n    \n  \n\n\n\n\n\nLearn more:\n\n\n\nArt Reach is a recurring event *almost every other Saturday\, where matches learn from an experienced art teacher and create a masterpiece to take home. \n\n\n\nAttend one or attend all\, but each Art Reach session focuses on a different art method and unique project\, so no two visits are the same! All skill levels welcome. \n\n\n\nThis event is great at instilling confidence in Littles (and Bigs) as they learn something new and bring their imagination alive.
URL:https://www.bebigforkids.org/event/match-event-art-reach-with-indianapolis-art-center/
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.bebigforkids.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/New-Indy-Art.jpg
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Big Brothers/Sisters 
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261122T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261122T170000
