CREATED:20261118T142947Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261118T142948Z
UID:10000391-1795359600-1795366800@www.bebigforkids.org
SUMMARY:Match Event: Match Meet-Up at The Children's Museum
DESCRIPTION:November              21              \, 2026            \n            BBBSCI hosts record-breaking annual gala\, “The Main Event\,” with Title Sponsor\, Delta Faucet Company           \n            \n\nJoin us for an evening of discovery and wonder at The Children’s Museum of Indianapolis! \n\n\n\n                            Email Us to Learn More\n                      \n        \n      \n    \n  \n\n\n\n\n\nLearn more:\n\n\n\nWe’re meeting up at the largest children’s museum in the world! Learning is intertwined with play for Littles and Bigs throughout interactive exhibits like the Dinosphere\, Beyond Spaceship Earth\, and ScienceWorks. If you’d rather cut straight to the play\, take a spin on the Carousel Wishes and Dreams or experience the magic of the first Disney exhibit in a children’s museum\, Tiana’s Joyful Celebration!
URL:https://www.bebigforkids.org/event/match-event-match-meet-up-at-the-childrens-museum/
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.bebigforkids.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/260629_TCMI_BigBrothersBigSisters_BigNightOut_19-scaled.jpg
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Big Brothers/Sisters 
DTSTART;TZID=UTC:20261201T080000
DTEND;TZID=UTC:20261201T170000
