UID:10000389-1796112000-1796144400@www.bebigforkids.org
SUMMARY:Giving Tuesday
DESCRIPTION:Unlock Magical Memories!\n                                      When you give to BBBSCI this Giving Tuesday\, December 1\, you’re unlocking bucket-list experiences for our Bigs and Littles to enjoy. Your support will help unlock Magical Memories\, which give up to 10 matches the chance to enjoy a new and unique experience together! \n\n                      \n          \n            Make a Donation          \n        \n      \n    \n  \n\n\n\n  \n    \n      \n            \n      \n        \n          \n                          \n                Make a Donation              \n                                      Your donation helps connect more young people in our community with life-changing mentorship resources! On Giving Tuesday\, your impact will be DOUBLED – as every dollar raised will be matched up to $100\,000\, thanks to the generous Larry & Lisa Sablosky. \n\n                        \n              Donate Today            \n          \n          \n                                            \n                        \n        \n      \n  \n\n\n\n  \n    \n      \n        \n          \n                          Become a Giving Tuesday Ambassador to Win a Bucket-List Experience\n                                      Calling Bigs! Share your story and inspire more mentors as a Giving Tuesday Ambassador. Join us to be entered to win a $500 Magical Memory experience\, raise critical dollars through your personalized fundraising page\, and inspire 100 more mentors this holiday season! \n\n                      \n          \n            Sign Up          \n        \n      \n    \n  \n\n\n\n  \n    \n      \n            \n      \n        \n          \n                          \n                Become a Big!              \n                                      With so many ways to mentor youth in our community\, being a Big and making a positive impact on the life a child is easier than ever. Sign-up to become a community-based or site-based mentor below – don’t forget to let us know who referred you! \n\n                        \n              Become a Mentor            \n          \n          \n                                            \n                        \n        \n      \n  \n\n\n\n  \n    \n              \n            \n        \n          \n                          \n                See the Impact              \n                                      Meet Little Sister Jaime and Big Sister Jaleesa\, 2026 National Big and Little of the Year.
URL:https://www.bebigforkids.org/event/giving-tuesday/
END:VEVENT
